msgid "Sorry, little guy. It ended up getting away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "*sniff* So then... I can't ever see my mommy again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Is everything all right over here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Not exactly. This kid got separated from his mother. Would you mind looking "
"after him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Is that right? Well, how about you come along with me, son?\r\n"
"I'll get you back to the station so we can find your mom.\r\n"
"Hopefully she didn't go too far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "No... I'm okay. I can find my own way home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Thanks for chasing after my balloon, mister..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
